{"id":"529c5a75-6021-467d-8741-9d9e0dca7e95","name":"Why MCP is awesome: one protocol, every tool","path":"WWW / Blog / Why MCP is awesome: one protocol, every tool","docTypeId":"7189041a-69ca-47ff-892a-e367366eb4a5","templateId":"ee187aa9-feed-41aa-8877-8f2041acc9a2","state":"Published","domains":[],"values":[{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextArea","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"excerpt","value":"The Model Context Protocol gives AI agents one standard way to talk to every tool they need. Here is why that changes how we build content sites."},{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.MediaPicker3","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"featuredImage","value":[{"key":"2c7b4fe3-ae88-43e9-81af-6e0ac7972e2a","mediaKey":"7ae9edf2-4e75-4962-8b07-f5f2a9d4b48f","mediaTypeAlias":"Image","crops":[],"focalPoint":null}]},{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.DateTime","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"publishedDate","value":"2026-10-07 00:00:00"},{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.BlockGrid","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"body","value":{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"$type":"BlockGridLayoutItem","columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1,"areas":[],"contentKey":"f2639f8d-e13c-4e67-b06b-e8ae5c25046d","settingsKey":null},{"$type":"BlockGridLayoutItem","columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1,"areas":[],"contentKey":"57428c1e-3bd8-4aa0-8154-e9b2712a41bd","settingsKey":null},{"$type":"BlockGridLayoutItem","columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1,"areas":[],"contentKey":"2c880ac6-96a8-4cbe-af3f-ffd56965112c","settingsKey":null},{"$type":"BlockGridLayoutItem","columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1,"areas":[],"contentKey":"15e609df-c03c-48f3-85ae-d8a9055fd591","settingsKey":null}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"976f9ffb-9d9b-40b0-9730-64dd9ddc830c","key":"f2639f8d-e13c-4e67-b06b-e8ae5c25046d","values":[{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"body","value":{"markup":"<p>If you have ever wired an AI assistant up to a handful of internal tools, you know the pain: every integration is a bespoke adapter, every schema is a snowflake, and the moment you add tool number six the whole thing starts to creak.</p><p>The Model Context Protocol (MCP) fixes this by standardising the conversation. One protocol, one discovery mechanism, one way to call a tool — no matter what the tool does or who built it.</p>","blocks":{"layout":{},"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[]}}}]},{"contentTypeKey":"2130109b-aa66-44b2-b932-b19b0d045d73","key":"57428c1e-3bd8-4aa0-8154-e9b2712a41bd","values":[{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextArea","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"quote","value":"MCP is the USB-C of AI tooling: one connector, and everything just plugs in."},{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"attribution","value":"The case for a universal tool protocol"}]},{"contentTypeKey":"3406fa98-72a3-4298-b06b-497c4d882f28","key":"2c880ac6-96a8-4cbe-af3f-ffd56965112c","values":[{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.MediaPicker3","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"image","value":[{"key":"f83653ed-bd04-494a-8740-0394320e8179","mediaKey":"a7392cd5-b43a-483d-94e1-8dfa3fadfd8e","mediaTypeAlias":"Image","crops":[],"focalPoint":null}]},{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"caption","value":"Cables that all speak the same protocol — photo by Hal Gatewood on Unsplash"}]},{"contentTypeKey":"976f9ffb-9d9b-40b0-9730-64dd9ddc830c","key":"15e609df-c03c-48f3-85ae-d8a9055fd591","values":[{"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","culture":null,"segment":null,"alias":"body","value":{"markup":"<p>For a content site like this one, the practical win is speed and consistency. The same server that reads the content tree writes to it — creating the schema, uploading the media and publishing the pages through one authenticated, versioned API.</p><p>No screen-scraping the backoffice. No brittle import scripts. Just a clean contract between the model and the CMS.</p>","blocks":{"layout":{},"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[]}}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"f2639f8d-e13c-4e67-b06b-e8ae5c25046d","culture":null,"segment":null},{"contentKey":"57428c1e-3bd8-4aa0-8154-e9b2712a41bd","culture":null,"segment":null},{"contentKey":"2c880ac6-96a8-4cbe-af3f-ffd56965112c","culture":null,"segment":null},{"contentKey":"15e609df-c03c-48f3-85ae-d8a9055fd591","culture":null,"segment":null}]}}],"urls":["/why-mcp-is-awesome-one-protocol-every-tool/"],"docType":"blogPost","template":"BlogPost"}
